# Database Structure

This project uses Prisma ORM for database access:

- [prisma/schema.prisma](mdc:prisma/schema.prisma) - Database schema definition
- [src/lib/db](mdc:src/lib/db) - Database access code
  - [src/lib/db/repositories](mdc:src/lib/db/repositories) - Repository pattern implementations
  - [src/lib/db/models](mdc:src/lib/db/models) - Data models and types

The database layer follows these patterns:
1. Use repositories for database access
2. Keep business logic separate from data access
3. Define models and types for database entities
